      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-07T18:46:48.822+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": "2026-11-07T18:46:56.553+00:00",
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "ATM there is \n`merge = (ctx.options.run_mode != 'deep')`\n\nSo if `run_mode` is anything but `deep` it performs a merge on the layer it extracts.",
      "author": {
        "id": "596068704471482370",
        "name": "246tnt",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "tnt",
